usage: run_spdz_prime256_autoregressive.py [-h] [--worker WORKER]
                                           [--result RESULT] [--output OUTPUT]
                                           [--bundle BUNDLE]
                                           [--native-root NATIVE_ROOT]
                                           [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                                           [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--steps STEPS]
                                           [--seed SEED]
                                           [--gpu-baseline-device GPU_BASELINE_DEVICE]
                                           [--baseline-repeats BASELINE_REPEATS]

Consume a fresh native fixed-model pool in a dependent trained micro stream.
Every next token comes from checked public output logits. This CPU/TLS runner
uses fresh row capabilities and square masks; it does not batch future inputs.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --worker WORKER
  --result RESULT
  --output OUTPUT
  --bundle BUNDLE
  --native-root NATIVE_ROOT
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --steps STEPS
  --seed SEED
  --gpu-baseline-device GPU_BASELINE_DEVICE
  --baseline-repeats BASELINE_REPEATS
